{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://wulouniu.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"The Park (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <i><b><a href=\"/wiki/The_Park_(Klimt)\" title=\"The Park (Klimt)\">The Park</a></b></i> <i>(pictured)</i> by <a href=\"/wiki/Gustav_Klimt\" title=\"Gustav Klimt\">Gustav Klimt</a> has been interpreted as producing a sense of anxiety in the viewer despite its \"apparently innocent depiction of a park\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Park_(Klimt)","retrieved":1779004630602},{"title":"Tray Wellington (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a href=\"/wiki/Tray_Wellington\" title=\"Tray Wellington\">Tray Wellington</a></b> was a part of the black reclamation of <a href=\"/wiki/Banjo\" title=\"Banjo\">banjo</a> music?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tray_Wellington","retrieved":1779004630603},{"title":"he needed ammunition, not a ride (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that, on the fourth anniversary of the <a href=\"/wiki/2022_Russian_invasion_of_Ukraine\" title=\"2022 Russian invasion of Ukraine\">2022 Russian invasion of Ukraine</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Volodymyr_Zelenskyy\" title=\"Volodymyr Zelenskyy\">Volodymyr Zelenskyy</a> gave a video address showing the bunker in which he told the US that <b><a href=\"/wiki/I_need_ammunition,_not_a_ride\" title=\"I need ammunition, not a ride\">he needed ammunition, not a ride</a></b>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/I_need_ammunition,_not_a_ride","retrieved":1779004630611},{"title":"Pamela Ball (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a href=\"/wiki/Pamela_Ball\" title=\"Pamela Ball\">Pamela Ball</a></b> was prouder of her mathematics degrees than of being the first Jamaican woman to be a fellow of the Royal College of Surgeons of England?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pamela_Ball","retrieved":1779004630612},{"title":"wrote in his book (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that Frank DeAngelis, the former principal of Columbine High School, <b><a href=\"/wiki/They_Call_Me_Mr._De\" title=\"They Call Me Mr. De\">wrote in his book</a></b> that he recites the names of the victims of the <a href=\"/wiki/Columbine_High_School_massacre\" title=\"Columbine High School massacre\">Columbine High School massacre</a> every day?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/They_Call_Me_Mr._De","retrieved":1779004630612},{"title":"Boracay Bridge (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that a contract for building the <b><a href=\"/wiki/Boracay_Bridge\" title=\"Boracay Bridge\">Boracay Bridge</a></b> was awarded despite opposition from <a href=\"/wiki/Malay,_Aklan\" title=\"Malay, Aklan\">the local municipality</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/Ati_people\" title=\"Ati people\">Ati people</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Victor_Bendico\" title=\"Victor Bendico\">the Archbishop of Capiz</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boracay_Bridge","retrieved":1779004630612},{"title":"Cifelliodon (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <i><b><a href=\"/wiki/Cifelliodon\" title=\"Cifelliodon\">Cifelliodon</a></b></i> is estimated to have been as large as a hare at a time when most other <a href=\"/wiki/Mammaliaformes\" title=\"Mammaliaformes\">mammaliaforms</a> were shrew- and mouse-sized?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cifelliodon","retrieved":1779004630613},{"title":"Spadina subway line (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that a test of the <b><a href=\"/wiki/Spadina_subway_line\" title=\"Spadina subway line\">Spadina subway line</a></b> took 3.5 hours and used a <a href=\"/wiki/Diesel_locomotive\" title=\"Diesel locomotive\">diesel locomotive</a> because electrical workers were on strike?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spadina_subway_line","retrieved":1779004630614},{"title":"Jordan Hadaway (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a href=\"/wiki/Jordan_Hadaway\" title=\"Jordan Hadaway\">Jordan Hadaway</a></b> was the youngest manager in Welsh senio